          "categories": [
            {
              "category": "approved",
              "description": "=The post has been reviewed and accepted as-is. The human explicitily or implicitily expresses approval, including that no changes are needed.\n\n\nExample pharases include:\n\n\"Looks good.\"\n\"Go ahead and send it.\"\n'This workd for me.\n\"Approved.\"\n\"No changes needed.\""
            },
            {
              "category": "declined",
              "description": "=The post has been reviewed, but human requests modifications before if is sent like tweake, removing parts, rewording, etc. This could include suggested edits. rewording, or major revisions.\n\nExample pharases include:\n\n\"Can we tweak this part?\"\n\"make it shorter\"\n\"change the source to 'American kennel Club'\"\n\"more emojis\""
